hub.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108892.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108892.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Type analysis would fail to infer the result of these operators as boolean if the argument did not have a static non-Variant type. This is inconsistent with the observed evaluation of these operators which returns a boolean for all possible types.\r\n\r\nFixes #108808.\r\n\r\nSomeone should probably check my work here. I'm not certain on coding style things like using `if` vs. `switch`. I can't help but feel like unnecessary work is being done before these new code paths. Also, it may be wrong! I have checked that the bitwise `&` and `|` have not been erroneously affected at least.\r\n\r\nOh, and I haven't written tests yet! I will do that.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108892/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108892/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}